          <div class="pub-authors">Edward Y. Chang, Longling Geng</div>
          <div class="pub-tldr"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Brings database-style ACID guarantees to multi-agent LLM systems — ensuring plans are atomic, consistent, and recoverable through compensating transactions.</div>
          <div class="pub-links">
